  "details": "Here are some bugs that i've encountered with the IK system:\n- IK breaks while crouching (the feet slide when the animator detects a crouched down position, regression from 2.0, happens on pretty much every 3.0 that I've tested). This was introduced with the 3.0 update;\n- IK stops working for a few seconds after stopping movement (noticed this with every avatar 3.0 and 2.0). This was introduced recently after the 3.0 update;\n(All this tested with a Valve Index + Controllers, no FBT)",
